<p>The Pentagon has publicly identified the six U.S. service members killed when a KC-135 aerial refueling aircraft crashed over western Iraq last week. U.S. Central Command said an unspecified incident led to the loss of the aircraft and that neither hostile fire nor friendly fire caused the crash, though the cause remains under investigation.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/5KkeomE_dbXaYHm3ufRxO6H_qdRIk9zBXD3BxbRyO3K2BVhGNIywysnl_ggMJM8Lx_MSbxYoGwgKr_diQoiI6vyEJuuz8SQl8Ugrq7DUVhgG8iT-194Ek5yOM5D6vyJDCMax6yJUEYdcQ_zehGc06fjar5QBBxT5eNs' alt='A KC-135 refueling aircraft image used in coverage of the Iraq crash.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Crew makeup: NDTV said three of the dead were active-duty U.S. Air Force members, while three served in the Air National Guard.</li><li>Mission context: According to The Hindu and CBS News, the KC-135 was supporting U.S. attacks on Iran when it crashed over Iraq.</li><li>Second aircraft: The Guardian said another refueling tanker involved in the broader incident landed safely in Israel.</li><li>Ages: Reports said the six identified airmen were between 28 and 38 years old.</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>U.S. Central Command: The command said an unspecified incident led to the loss of the KC-135, and that neither hostile fire nor friendly fire brought it down. Investigators are still working to determine the cause. (<a href='https://www.lemonde.fr/en/international/article/2026/03/15/us-military-identifies-six-soldiers-killed-in-iraq-plane-crash_6751457_4.html'>Le Monde</a>)</li><li>Pentagon: The department&#x27;s identification of the dead showed the loss reached across both officer and enlisted ranks, including one major, three captains, and two technical sergeants. (<a href='https://www.firstpost.com/world/pentagon-identifies-all-6-us-airmen-killed-in-refuelling-plane-crash-over-iraq-13989615.html'>Firstpost</a>)</li><li>Islamic Resistance in Iraq: The militia group claimed it downed a KC-135, offering a sharply different account from the U.S. military&#x27;s preliminary assessment. (<a href='https://www.lemonde.fr/en/international/article/2026/03/15/us-military-identifies-six-soldiers-killed-in-iraq-plane-crash_6751457_4.html'>Le Monde</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.firstpost.com/world/pentagon-identifies-all-6-us-airmen-killed-in-refuelling-plane-crash-over-iraq-13989615.html'>Pentagon identifies all 6 US airmen killed in refuelling plane crash over Iraq</a> - firstpost.com</li><li><a href='https://www.ndtv.com/world-news/us-iran-war-john-klinner-ariana-savino-ashley-pruitt-seth-koval-curtis-angst-tyler-simmons-among-6-us-soldiers-killed-in-iraq-crash-11217245#publisher=newsstand'>&quot;Died Doing What She Loved&quot;: Captain Among 6 US Soldiers Killed In Iraq Crash</a> - ndtv.com</li><li><a href='https://www.lemonde.fr/en/international/article/2026/03/15/us-military-identifies-six-soldiers-killed-in-iraq-plane-crash_6751457_4.html'>US military identifies six soldiers killed in Iraq plane crash</a> - lemonde.fr</li><li><a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/us-identifies-six-service-members-killed-in-plane-crash-over-iraq/article70745820.ece'>U.S. identifies six service members killed in plane crash over Iraq</a> - thehindu.com</li><li><a href='https://www.cbsnews.com/news/iran-war-kc-135-us-plane-crash-iraq-crew-deaths-confirmed/'>All 6 crew members killed in crash of U.S. KC-135 refueling aircraft in Iraq</a> - cbsnews.com</li><li><a href='https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/mar/14/us-service-members-killed-identified'>Pentagon identifies six US service members killed in aircraft crash over Iraq</a> - theguardian.com</li></ul>